# Bike Race V4.1 (bikerc3f) -- free play + PRESS START end-to-end test.
#
# Needs the "Balls" setting at 3 (Tab -> Dip Switches), or the machine sits on
# "FALTAN n BOLAS" and no game can start.  With the ball model on, the trough
# optos read "ball home", so each ball drains by itself and three of them reach
# game over without any drain key.
#
# What to watch:
#   ~frame 700   one START press begins a game with NO credits inserted (free play)
#   ~frame 4400  game over -- the score must STAY on the panel, with PULSE START
#   ~frame 6500  a second START press releases it and attract resumes

600 mark boot
700 tap 20 KEYCODE_1          # START -- free play, no coin needed
900 mark game-started
1000 tap 4 KEYCODE_Q
1024 tap 4 KEYCODE_W
1048 tap 4 KEYCODE_E
1072 tap 4 KEYCODE_R
1096 tap 4 KEYCODE_A
1120 tap 4 KEYCODE_S
1144 tap 4 KEYCODE_D
1168 tap 4 KEYCODE_F
1192 tap 4 KEYCODE_Z
1216 tap 4 KEYCODE_X
1240 tap 4 KEYCODE_C
